  refine theorem3_faithful_multiF_LR GrA mvA (FM gA gsA) domLA domRA
    (leftProgsA dt) (canonInvM gA gsA) (encode_canonInvM gA gsA) ?_ ?_ ?_
  · exact hdis_multi GrA 0 1 dt leftDataA (by decide) httA hRvA hLA
  · exact hstep_assembled_multiF GrA mvA (FM gA gsA) envA (leftProgsA dt)
      hmvFA hmvenvA hfreshA httA hltA (hframesA dt)
      (HmultiA dt hdt hv)
  · exact hddF_multiE GrA 0 1 dt leftDataA (canonInvM gA gsA) domLA domRA
      (by decide) httA hRvA hLA
      (canonInvM_varsL gA gsA (by
        intro g' hg'
        simp only [gA, gsA, List.mem_cons, List.not_mem_nil, or_false] at hg'
        rcases hg' with rfl | rfl | rfl <;> exact hgAt _))
      (canonInvM_varsR gA gsA) hdomLA hdomRA

